# Line endings. The repository stores LF; with core.autocrlf=true and no rule
# here, Git on Windows checks shell files out as CRLF, and bash then reads
# "exec bun run precommit\r" or a "$VAR\r" and fails. These run under bash
# on every platform (the pre-commit hook, the CI helpers), so they stay LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
